# GarageGuru SDLC

- Tickets live in Jira project GG: https://anka.atlassian.net/jira/software/projects/GG
- Branch: `feature/GG-n-short-name`
- Commit and PR title must include `GG-n`
- Open a pull request. Do not push to main. Do not deploy production.
- Work only in this repository. Other GarageGuru apps have their own repos and PRs.
